# Flash on Bot2's turn: Bot2's Lightning Bolt (3 damage) targets Bot1's Grizzly Bears and Bot1 responds with Frantic Strength, so the 4/4
# Bears survive with 3 damage marked (+2/+2, CR 704.5g). A second Bolt (3 more, 6 total >= 4) kills them, and Frantic Strength, no longer
# attached to anything, is put into its owner's graveyard as a state-based action (CR 704.5m).

